join Mage rightmost
join Barbarian leftmost
if {mage.Phase 1} == false:
	Mage: Hey you!
	Barbarian: Do I know you?
	Mage: No, but I need help and you look capable enough to do so.
	Mage: I will reward you for your troubles ofcourse.
	label choice quest 1
	- Help the mage
		Barbarian: Sure, What is it you need my help with?
		Mage: I need you to finish this game.
		Barbarian: Fine...
		set {mage.Accepted quest} = true
	- Ignore the mage
		Barbarian: There is nothing a mage like you can offer me.
		[signal arg="denied"]
		Mage: So rude \:(
	set {mage.Phase 1} = true
else:
	if {mage.Accepted quest} == false:
		Mage: Just leave me here, I'm a wothless mage.
		jump choice quest 1
	else:
		Mage: You should get back to working on this game
